        /// <summary>The authorization event feed: tuple writes and deletes (by API call and by the sync), new model versions and sync runs, in order. Pass the last `seq` you processed as `after` (or `latest` to start from now). `wait_ms` (up to 25000) holds the request open until something newer appears, so a local policy decision point can refresh the moment a tuple changes. At-least-once: drop an entry whose `id` you have seen. Entries are kept 7 days. Needs an API key that is not limited to organizations.</summary>
