        /// <summary>Why does this subject have, or not have, this access? Asks RBAC (organization roles, member permissions, app roles), delegated org roles, groups, resource roles, ABAC, access policies and FGA the same question and returns each rule that contributed, with the reason it applied or not and an overall decision. Layers without enough input are `skipped` and say what is missing; a failing layer is `error` and never decides alone. Read-only. Needs an API key that is not limited to organizations.</summary>
        /// <remarks>POST /v1/authz/explain. Scope: <c>authz_decisions:read</c>.</remarks>
